{"server":"cn","storyId":"act28side_level_act28side_03_beg","groupId":"act28side","stageId":"act28side_03","title":"圈套","storyCode":"CV-3","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act28side/level_act28side_03_beg.txt","sourceHash":"6a1b1ab60813b92c534818af4e775aec9a991e454f5fa64dd45c4606e9c8991e","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g6_sonwydowntown_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去银行贷款？你疯了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你说怎么办？就这么几天时间，你到底怎么凑齐去特里蒙的车费？这次临床试验是提比最后的机会了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再想想办法......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么办法？除了贷款，已经没别的办法了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对、对了，我们之前给提比投过重病保险的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以为我昨天下午去干什么了？我去了银行想兑现保险，可提比的病根本不在他们的理赔范围内！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算我求你，那也先别想贷款的事，好不好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想想你姐姐，她就借了一笔小钱，可就因为那笔钱破了产，被搞得那么惨，最后......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一家人都死在了去拓荒地的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你先冷静一下，一定还有别的办法......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次来银行都能看见这样的事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我们更要来银行，更要来参加这个所谓的“答谢酒会”，芙兰卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不来亲眼见识见识......我们只会更加一无所知。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ltroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"由巴伦基地亲自来拖拽达维镇回到原本的航路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此次任务是受州政府直接委托，最终结果会直接关系到黑钢的信誉与形象，我们一定会尽力而为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可真是太好了，我们不胜感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"该做的而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"二位要喝啤酒还是香槟？我们这种小地方，能提供的东西未免不尽如人意，二位请多担待。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不尽如人意？您太谦虚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看看，队长，这啤酒瓶上虽然没有商标，质量可不比一些精酿厂的小众品牌差，这边的香槟也是高级货......好品味啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"作为派驻艰苦地区的福利，我们的物资供应里确实会有些相对高级一点的东西，毕竟大家也是要维持士气的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能让人敞开喝冰啤酒的供暖力度也是维持士气的一环？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......正如您所说，包括电力和取暖在内，我们有一套独立的备用供能系统。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他建筑好像没有这套备用系统啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是在早期规划建设时，第一任行长出于安全考虑做下的英明决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"金融机构提供的服务相对特殊，大笔资金流入流出，无论系统或者资源，都是自己的用着更靠谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必黑钢在达维镇营建自己的安全屋也是出于同样的考虑，您说呢，芙兰卡女士？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......来杯水就行，这瓶啤酒还是留给贵行员工加油打气吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此次达维镇动力炉的修复情况，我们已经派人赶回黑钢总部汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在动力炉仍然没能恢复供应航行的能力，想必总部会拟定新的解决方案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们也很感激贵公司对达维镇的付出。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，在解决方案出台之前，我们有个不情之请。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙兰卡","speakerId":"avg_106_franka_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不情之请？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们希望各位帮助维护达维镇的治安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位在地块外围应该遇见了些匪徒。他们给这里造成了很大损失，更令人担忧的是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这地块上有些人，说得好听些是混混，说得难听一些，就是那些匪徒的后备军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果各位可以帮忙将他们清除出达维镇的话，我们不胜感激。这里有份名单......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这几天，我们已经派出人手在地块外围执行警戒的任务，根据他们的报告，我不认为地块上有这么多危险分子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些已经破产，却不愿用辛勤劳动来偿还债务的家伙，难保哪天不会铤而走险，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然您这么说，我们会再详细核查的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“详细核查”？您确定？您不信任我们的话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"雷蛇","speakerId":"avg_107_liskam_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果因为核查一份名单就损伤了我们对贵行的信任，那这样的信任，未免也太脆弱。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......无妨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"银行经理","speakerId":"avg_npc_1041_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您既然想查，就彻彻底底地查一遍好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么样？你们那边有发现吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯，目标人物已经进入视线范围......来的似乎不只有他一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有同伙吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"......像是地块上的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生，这......这可能吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么不可能的。地块上的政府崩溃后，有些游手好闲的年轻人就组了帮派，到处惹事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......他们勾结这些荒地流匪是要干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"杰西卡小姐......他们好像要分开了，需要实行抓捕吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伍德洛先生......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先等等，还不是时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......暂时先不要行动，记下他们出没的位置，等到再出现时，及时联系我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好，没问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍等。那些流匪是从哪个方向离开的？我跟过去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"往东南方向去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要我一起吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我一个人就够。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伍德洛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1034_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以先回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"杰西卡小姐......那位先生是地块上的人吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他之前就在调查这伙流匪，我们的任务他可以帮忙的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我......杰西卡小姐，有句话我不该说，但还是得提醒你......和当地的人走得太近，其实最后不是什么好事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为、为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"像达维镇这样的地块，政府回收后不会继续维持原样，肯定另有安排，到时候地块上的产业、设施......甚至是居民，都是要换一拨的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"换一拨？那原来的人呢？他们会去哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"我不知道黑钢会如何处理，但是在我的老东家，他们只负责赶人，赶出去的人去哪里，变成什么样，他们根本不关心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不关心？！这是违法的事情，他们凭什么赶走地块上的合法居民？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":"avg_npc_1045_1","isRemote":true,"text":"唉......这种快要破产的地块，由头多得是啊。什么欠债、税务调查、安全隐患......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠债......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不光是我，地块上的所有人都欠债了。唉......话都说到这份上了，我就直说了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一来就问的，那个往雪地里去的男人，多半就是因为债务......之前这样的事情不少，欠了债后破产，走投无路就只好......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑钢佣兵","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"杰西卡，嘿，杰西卡！你怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我得先回去了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g8_abandonedblock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你那个死犟的老爹......今天就......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......跟他废话什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"模糊的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......放开我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小孩子的声音？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g8_abandonedblock"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狠毒的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这小子真能嚎，我看堵住嘴之后得打他一顿他才能老实跟我们走——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，把人放了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迟钝的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放人？你算什么东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救命！他们要绑架我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我再说一遍，把那个孩子放了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迟钝的混混","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他爹欠了那么多钱，把这小崽子卖了都不够还的，绑架又怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欠钱？欠银行的钱？你们是替银行做事的？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狠毒的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别来多管闲事，赶紧滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救救我——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狠毒的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别嚎了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃、咳......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最后说一遍，别乱动，把孩子放了，否则下一发子弹就不是示警了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狠毒的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......啧，算你够狠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"狠毒的混混","speakerId":"avg_npc_1044_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们走，没必要为了这小崽子把命搭进去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你叫什么名字？你家在哪里，我送你回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫本尼......你送我去前面的餐馆就好，我爸每天晚上都会去，我在那里等他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你爸爸，是里昂先生吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我认识他。对了，那两个人说到欠钱的事......是银行雇了他们来催收的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，一开始寄催收信，然后是派人来我家闹事，被爸爸赶了出去，这次银行大概就想用我逼爸爸还钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这是绑架......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"地块上又没有警察。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......能给我看看你爸爸的账单吗？也许我能帮上忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......认真的？他的账单多得可怕......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g1_mine"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一圈看下来，能源塔里......没什么我们能做的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早跟你说过，罗拉那小姑娘做事情很利索，该修补的地方都弄好了，你还非要来跑一趟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想看看还有没有什么事，黑钢没做，我们能做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得这样黑钢就会付你更多钱，让你把银行的贷款还清？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......至少有点指望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还不如指望天上下金券。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早跟你说过，把矿厂的股份卖了，这是你现在唯一能走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你在这些股份上花了一辈子的积蓄，还贷了款——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行就是不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我问你，黑钢付你的钱能让你平多少账？该不会连利息都付不清吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那这样，你帮我维护动力炉，正好这几天它能烧黑钢带来的燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我呢，正好放几天假，黑钢付我的那笔钱就当是你的报酬了，帮你从银行手里争取一点想清楚的时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不行，迈尔斯，那是你自己的血汗钱，再说这和白给有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"迈尔斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1038_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这也不行，那也不行，等银行帮你宣布破产，把一切都抢走的时候，你也靠一句不行把他们打发了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"里昂","speakerId":"avg_npc_1035_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......总会有办法的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g3_diner"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啤酒、电费、担保......都还好，还在我能负担的范围之内......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你能负担的范围......你要替里昂还债？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"假如可能的话，是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸最怕欠人情。我哥哥去世之后，他付不起丧葬费，别人要借他钱，他都说别人把他当乞丐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他最后跟着伍德洛先生在地块外，伐木、打猎、捕鳞......高强度做了两个月，回来后手指变形得厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最后得了多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概两三千吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......他的债可没法这么还啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等......里昂先生还是矿厂的股东？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别提了，矿厂彻底停工之后，为了继续持有这些股份，他要交燃料费、空置费、地块管理费......每年都要找银行借一大笔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这简直就是在自己身上开了一个放血的口子啊，就算我来帮他也不可能还得清......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果不把矿厂的股份卖了，后面里昂先生只会什么也不剩的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不可能。爸爸爱他的矿厂胜过一切，就算让他带着我一起去拓荒地做苦力，他也绝对不会放手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，别这么说话，你知道你爸爸不是这样的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，杰西卡，你这么着急，到底出什么事了？里昂毕竟是矿厂的股东，银行应该没那么快宣布他破产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我看到有人想要绑架本尼......来逼迫里昂先生还账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绑架？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"缠着里昂也就算了，绑架一个十来岁的孩子......他们也真下得去手！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本尼，这几天你住我这儿。等里昂发现自己孩子不见了，我倒要好好问问他，他这个父亲是干什么吃的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你别跟他说，我不想让他担心......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这不是让不让他担心的事，他得知道自己做的事情有什么后果！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"本尼","speakerId":"avg_npc_1037_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我还是得回家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，这犟种怎么就能有你这么个乖儿子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管怎么说，如果里昂先生愿意出售那些股份，再加上他没注意到的一些退税和优惠政策，他应该是能还上欠款的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"杰西卡","speakerId":"avg_1034_jesca2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......基本可以确定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"海伦娜","speakerId":"avg_4104_coldst_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我看也确实需要个人来提醒提醒他，不能再由着性子做事了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g4_bank"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"终于结束了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以为什么全楼的总开关离大门口正好一百步远？这也是银行创始人的深谋远虑？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......怎么可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......根本没有道理可讲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一步，两步，三步......七步的位置有个柜台，在那里左转......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......二十四，二十五，二十六......啊，碰到那盏灯了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"五十七，五十八，五十九......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一百。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"银行还没有下班吧？我......我想贷一笔钱——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"西尔维娅？西尔维娅，你快过来，我想找银行贷一笔钱，能不能在利息上稍微优惠一点，我平时不该对你那么凶的——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"暴躁的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1043_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"焦虑的男性","speakerId":"avg_npc_1042_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你呢......你为什么会出现在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，二位，我们今天已经下班了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看着夫妻二人相顾无言，西尔维娅低下头，离开了银行大门口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"42_g7_sonwydowntown_n"},{"type":"narration","text":"一路上，街灯无法驱散的浓重黑暗陪着她，亲昵地搂着她的脖子。\n母亲去世以后，她每天都这样下班。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一千八百七十七，一千八百七十八，到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"西尔维娅","speakerId":"avg_npc_1039_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈，我到家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等了许久，门后面依旧是一片寂静。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"片刻，她拿出钥匙，打开了门，在门垫上蹭了蹭鞋底，把令人窒息的黑暗留在了身后的大街上。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
